# Pure SaaS: /pure-saas audit

Comprehensive quality audit across visual hierarchy, responsive behavior, accessibility, and tokens.

## Usage
Type `@pure-saas-audit [scope]` or `/pure-saas audit [scope]` in Composer or Chat.

## Instructions
1. Evaluate visual hierarchy, anti-slop compliance (`references/anti-slop-rules.md`), typography measure (45–75ch), and surface elevation.
2. Check responsive overflow at 1440px desktop, 768px tablet, and 375px mobile viewports.
3. Check WCAG 2.2 AA accessibility: color contrast (≥4.5:1), visible focus rings, and semantic HTML landmarks.
4. Run `node scripts/pure-saas.mjs check-tokens DESIGN.md --source src` to detect unmapped styles.
5. Produce findings categorized by severity (Critical, High, Medium, Low). Do not modify files during an audit.
